OL,3,GNEWSAFree things to do in the North
OL,4,AWest this half-term
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith the kids off school for the autumn
OL,7,Fhalf-term break, many parents will be
OL,8,Flooking for fun ways to fill the week
OL,9,Fwithout breaking the bank.
OL,11,FFrom pumpkin carving and spooky crafts
OL,12,Fto fish feeding and swimming sessions,
OL,13,Fhere are just some of the free
OL,14,Factivities that are available.
OL,16,FPaper Pumpkin Trail, Weaver Hall Museum
OL,17,Fand Workhouse, Northwich. From 24
OL,18,FOctober to 1 November a free
OL,19,FHalloween-themed trail will take
OL,20,Fvisitors all around the history and
OL,21,Findustry museum.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
